<title>THAILAND: Thai April BOP deficit 15.5 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai April BOP deficit 15.5 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's April balance of payments deficit was 15.5 billion baht compared with a deficit of 700 million baht in March, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The Thai March manufacturing index rose 6.4 percent year on year and against a three percent increase posted in February.</p>
<p>The private investment index rose 5.9 percent year on year in March and against a 5.9 percent rise in February, it added.</p>
